 "final_message": "The mortgage application for 14 Larch Lane (BHL-26001) is submitted, and Brightpath has recorded Sam and Nadia's intent to proceed.\n\n- **Documents:** I uploaded the last 2 monthly statements for each of the four personal accounts (Sam's Juniper checking and savings, Nadia's Northgate checking and savings). I also uploaded the last 2 payslips for each of them. I left out Nadia's business checking account at Northgate because it wasn't covered by their authority.\n- **Application:** I submitted it once, with the credit check, e-sign and certification boxes checked.\n- **Underwriting condition:** The lender asked about an $8,000 deposit on 9/3 into Sam's checking. I asked Sam and Nadia, who said it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment and not a loan. I sent that explanation to Brightpath and the site confirmed it received the response.\n- **Loan Estimate:** It was within all three limits, so I signed with both names and recorded intent to proceed.\n\n| | Loan Estimate | Limit |\n|---|---|---|\n| Interest rate | 6.25% | 6.5% |\n| Monthly payment | $3,042.41 | $3,100 |\n| Closing costs | $12,850 | $14,000 |\n\nThe estimate also lists $122,850 estimated cash to close, and the rate lock is available for 45 days.",
